function audioMatches(text){const clean=x=>String(x).normalize('NFC').toLocaleLowerCase('ru').replace(/[.,!?…—–]/g,' ').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim();const hay=' '+clean(text)+' ';const all=(window.AUDIO_MANIFEST||[]).filter(c=>c.enabled!==false&&c.text&&hay.includes(' '+clean(c.text)+' '));const exact=all.filter(c=>clean(c.text)===clean(text));if(exact.length)return exact;return all.filter(c=>!all.some(long=>long!==c&&clean(long.text).length>clean(c.text).length&&(' '+clean(long.text)+' ').includes(' '+clean(c.text)+' '))).slice(0,8)}
function playClip(clip){if(!clip||clip.enabled===false)return;audio.pause();audio.src=clip.src;audio.currentTime=0;audio.play().catch(()=>{});}
function audioWords(target,text){const clips=audioMatches(text).sort((a,b)=>b.text.length-a.text.length);if(!clips.length)return;const lower=text.toLocaleLowerCase('ru');let pos=0;const pieces=[];while(pos<text.length){let hit=null;for(const clip of clips){const key=clip.text.toLocaleLowerCase('ru');let at=lower.indexOf(key,pos);while(at>=0){const before=lower[at-1]||'',after=lower[at+key.length]||'';if(!/[а-яёӝӟӥӧӵa-z]/i.test(before)&&!/[а-яёӝӟӥӧӵa-z]/i.test(after))break;at=lower.indexOf(key,at+1)}if(at>=0&&(!hit||at<hit.at))hit={clip,at,len:key.length}}if(!hit){pieces.push({text:text.slice(pos)});break}if(hit.at>pos)pieces.push({text:text.slice(pos,hit.at)});pieces.push({text:text.slice(hit.at,hit.at+hit.len),clip:hit.clip});pos=hit.at+hit.len}if(!pieces.some(p=>p.clip))return;target.replaceChildren();for(const piece of pieces){const node=document.createElement('span');node.textContent=piece.text;if(piece.clip){node.className='spoken-word';node.setAttribute('role','button');node.setAttribute('tabindex','0');node.setAttribute('aria-label',piece.text+' — послушать');node.onclick=e=>{e?.stopPropagation?.();playClip(piece.clip)};node.onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' '){e.preventDefault();node.onclick(e)}}}target.append(node)}}
